{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53153","headline":"寄劝俗兄弟二首 二 · 法照","name":"寄劝俗兄弟二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兄弟同居忍便安，莫因毫末起争端。\n眼前生子又兄弟，留与儿孙作样看。\n（见影清光绪抄本张鹏翼修《洋县志》卷七）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"法照","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53153.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53153","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}